    {
      "id": "weather_smalltalk_003_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私は、早い冬の朝が好き。空気が静かで、ノートが開きやすい感じがする。",
      "translatedText": "I like early winter mornings. The air is quiet, and notebooks feel easier to open.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "happy",
        "pose": "glasses_adjust",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "weather_smalltalk_003_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "weather_smalltalk_003_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "でも、手が冷えると作業が急に難しくなる。",
      "translatedText": "But when your hands get cold, work suddenly becomes harder.",
      "emotion": "thinking",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "thinking",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "weather_smalltalk_003_05"
    },
    {
      "id": "weather_smalltalk_003_05",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "だから、あたたかくしてから始めよう。根性で指先は温まらないから。",
      "translatedText": "So warm up before starting. Willpower does not warm fingertips.",
      "emotion": "playful",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "playful",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
